Model weights
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This service loads the TimesFM 3.0 weights published by Google Research at
https://huggingface.co/google/timesfm-3.0-pytorch

The weights are NOT distributed with this repository: they are downloaded at
runtime from HuggingFace, and they carry their own separate terms --
the "TimesFM Non-Commercial License v1.0", which restricts them to
non-commercial, non-production use.

Upstream is explicit about this split: the TimesFM source code is Apache-2.0,
and so are the weights up to version 2.5; only the 3.0 pretrained weights carry
the separate non-commercial license. See the "License notice for pretrained
weights" section of https://github.com/google-research/timesfm

The Apache-2.0 license of this repository covers only the code written here.
It grants no rights whatsoever over the model weights. Anyone running this
service is responsible for complying with Google's terms for the checkpoint
they load. TimesFM 2.5 weights are published under Apache-2.0 and do not carry
that restriction, but its Python API differs (`timesfm` instead of `timesfm3`).

